("Routes: 10.0.0.0/8, 10.1.0.0/16, 10.1.1.0/24. The destination is 10.1.1.200. Which route has the longest prefix match?",["/8","/16","/24","Equal cost"],"C","The longest matching prefix wins.","Addresses were garbled in the transcript. I rebuilt them from the answer."),
("What is true about `switchport mode dynamic auto`?",["It forces a trunk.","It is a passive DTP mode.","It disables DTP.","It creates a permanent access port."],"B","Dynamic auto waits for the other side to negotiate.",""),
