("SW1 uses `channel-group 1 mode active` and SW2 uses `channel-group 1 mode on`. Why does the EtherChannel fail?",["Active requires passive or active, not on","LACP and static modes mismatch","VLAN mismatch","Port security conflict"],"B","Active = LACP. On = static. A mismatch stops the bundle forming.","A and B are close. B is the cleaner answer."),
